  <metadata>
    <name>Edmonton city loop</name>
    <desc>A sample steward visit track that goes around the city of Edmonton, Alberta. The ring follows the city outline: start at West Edmonton Mall, through the southwest and the south side, up the east side, along the north edge, and back to the start.</desc>
  </metadata>
